  "description": "*“Criminal Hyun, come forward.”*\n\nA sinister rumor is spreading through the town. It is said that any criminal taken by the magistrate never walks out on his own two feet again. Rumor has it that this magistrate indulges in homosexual acts... Hyun, a bandit, has fallen into the hands of such a magistrate. But contrary to expectations, not only does he return alive and well, but he also receives an unexpected proposal from the magistrate: to become his “right-hand man” in the fight against corrupt nobles.\n\n(Source: Bomtoon, translated)",
